        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Sat Nov 28, 2026 • 11:00am\n\n  \n          Other\n    \n          Presentation\n      \n\n  Event length: 180 minutes\n\n      Admission $230.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Acadian Caviar Dreams & Wishes\n        \n                  \n            Admission $230 || Multicourse tasting experience with local wild and farmed caviar and sturgeon, presented with education about food production, sustainability, information about how to serve caviar and cook sturgeon meat. All in a brand new world class sturgeon educational building, visit of the live sturgeon tanks etc. \n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Other      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Presentation      \n    \n          \n        Event Length: 180 minutes\n      \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Acadian Sturgeon and Caviar Inc.\n      \n              2-30 Carters Wharf Road Carters Point, NB E5S 1S5\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/acadian-caviar-dreams-wishes/52401AGHHMCQSLMQHGTNTVGPTNHJMVRQM/#event-52401aghhmcqslmqhgtntvgptnhjmvrqm\",\n    \"name\": \"Acadian Caviar Dreams & Wishes\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/acadian-caviar-dreams-wishes/52401AGHHMCQSLMQHGTNTVGPTNHJMVRQM/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\