nt, hosted by Fusion Saint John, shines a spotlight on the individuals, organizations, and businesses helping to move the Saint John region forward. Each year, Faces of Fusion brings together an inspiring mix of changemakers: newcomers driving innovation, lifelong residents building stronger communities, and leaders lifting up the next generation. It’s a powerful celebration of progress, passion, and the people who make our city a better place to live. For 25 years, Fusion Saint John has been committed to creating spaces for connection, collaboration, and opportunity. As a volunteer-led non-profit, our mission is to build a stronger, more inclusive Saint John by helping people feel welcomed, inspired, and engaged in shaping our shared future. Throughout the year, we host meetups, workshops, and networking events that bring people together — but Faces of Fusion is our marquee event. It’s a night of recognition and connection that highlights the heart and soul of this city. Let’s celebrate what makes this city exceptional — together. Join us February 19th for Faces of Fusion 2027!\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/1488adcc-dc8c-4cb7-b5ac-3cf84d35ffe0.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-02-19T17:00:00-04:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=47001AKGBPVRNLLTLGMHBTDTNRJQVNRCM\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-02-19T17:00:00-04:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Faces of Fusion\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
