our tickets and we’ll C! you there! #NeverStopSingingSocial Links   WebsiteFacebookInstagramYoutubeTikTokTwitter\n\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Tribute      \n    \n          \n        Event Length: 90 minutes\n      \n    \n      \n  \n  \t  \t  \n    \tPerformer Website:\n    \t\n      Visit Website\n    \t\n      \n\t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/landslide-an-epic-fleetwood-mac-sing-along-with-choir-choir-choir/49801AVVVJQRDHHCHGRNLMSSLHRNCVBPM/#event-49801avvvjqrdhhchgrnlmsslhrncvbpm\",\n    \"name\": \"Landslide: An EPIC Fleetwood Mac Sing-Along with Choir! Choir! Choir!\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/landslide-an-epic-fleetwood-mac-sing-along-with-choir-choir-choir/49801AVVVJQRDHHCHGRNLMSSLHRNCVBPM/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Advance P1 $61.25 | P2 $56.25 | P3 $51.25 ~ Day of P1 $66.25 | P2 $61.25| P3 $56.25 || “Why see a show when you can BE the show!?” Choir! Choir! Choir! is the fully interactive, participatory show that turns audience into performer! So get ready to laugh, dance and SING! your hearts out with hundreds of other music-lovers just like you. It’s like a big birthday party for the greatest songs of all time and you’re invited! So grab a friend (or ten), and come out ready to GIVE IT ALL YOU’VE GOT! - all voices welcome, no experience necessary. They Teach, You Sing! Everyone Wins! This time, Choir!Choir!Choir! Presents: Landslide: An EPIC Fleetwood Mac Sing-Along Nothing feels better than belting out song like these with a room full of Fleetwood Mac fans! Channel your inner Stevie Nicks, grab your best friends and frenemies, and create harmonies that you won’t believe! Landslide: An EPIC Fleetwood Mac Sing-Along will be the most fun you’ve had in years… Since 2011, Choir! Choir! Choir! directors Daveed Goldman + Nobu Adilman have blurred the lines between performer and audience, traveling the world to create harmony with strangers and friends alike. They’ve collaborated with renowned artists like Patti Smith, David Byrne, Brandi Carlile, Rick Astley, Rufus Wainwright, and even Kermit The Frog at New York’s Lincoln Center, creating memorable videos that have garnered views in the millions. Now it’s your turn to SING!, so grab your friends, get your tickets and we’ll C! you there! #NeverStopSinging\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/b55ab5f0-b6ff-41d8-a1c3-6977d5e73352.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-03-03T20:00:00-04:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=49801AVVVJQRDHHCHGRNLMSSLHRNCVBPM\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-03-03T20:00:00-04:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Landslide: An EPIC Fleetwood Mac Sing-Along with Choir! Choir! Choir!\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t"
      }
    ]
