        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Sat Mar 13, 2027 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Folk / Alt\n      \n\n\n      Admission $42.50\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n      \n      IT Member Event\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Ben Caplan\n        \n                  \n            $42.50 Regular | $37.50 Members ||\nBen Caplan is redefining what it means to be a modern folk artist. His music, rooted in rich\ntraditions of Eastern European folk yet infused with contemporary flair, is matched by his\nlarger-than-life stage presence. Caplan’s work is powerful, poetic, and deeply human. His ability\nto connect to audiences with stories and melodies that transcend genre has made him an\nunmissable act with a following around the world. His newest album, The Flood, pushes\nboundaries through the strength of his talented and diverse collaborators.\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Folk / Alt      \n    \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/ben-caplan/48801AQHMRLTRLKHTVVSGQHTMLHGKSGHS/#event-48801aqhmrltrlkhtvvsgqhtmlhgksghs\",\n    \"name\": \"Ben Caplan\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/ben-caplan/48801AQHMRLTRLKHTVVSGQHTMLHGKSGHS/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://