    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Regular $63.75 | Senior $52.25 || The Snowed In Comedy Tour is back with a brand new show! Now celebrating its 18th year, what began as a wild idea in the middle of a Canadian winter has snowballed into a national phenomenon and Canada's biggest comedy tour. This year's powerhouse lineup features Dan Quinn, Just for Laughs competition winner and tour founder; Paul Myrehaug, winner of the $25,000 Great Canadian Laugh Off; Pete Zedlacher, SiriusXM Top Comic winner and 6-time Canadian Comedy Award nominee; and Erica Sigurdson, one of CBC's The Debaters most popular performers with more than 80 appearances. Four international comedians. One stage. Eighteen years of laughs. Critics call it “Better than the Just for Laughs Tour” and “A Flurry of Laughs You Can't Miss.”"
      }
