        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Thu Apr 8, 2027 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Comedy\n    \n          Presentation\n      \n\n  Event length: 120 minutes\n\n      Admission $63.75 | Senior $46.25\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Snowed In Comedy Tour\n        \n                  \n            Regular $63.75 | Senior $52.25 || \nThe Snowed In Comedy Tour is back with a brand new show!\nNow celebrating its 18th year, what began as a wild idea in the middle of a Canadian winter has\nsnowballed into a national phenomenon and Canada's biggest comedy tour.\nThis year's powerhouse lineup features Dan Quinn, Just for Laughs competition winner and tour\nfounder; Paul Myrehaug, winner of the $25,000 Great Canadian Laugh Off; Pete Zedlacher,\nSiriusXM Top Comic winner and 6-time Canadian Comedy Award nominee; and Erica\nSigurdson, one of CBC's The Debaters most popular performers with more than 80\nappearances.\nFour international comedians. One stage. Eighteen years of laughs.\nCritics call it “Better than the Just for Laughs Tour” and “A Flurry of Laughs You Can't\nMiss.”\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Comedy      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Presentation      \n    \n          \n        Event Length: 120 minutes\n      \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snowed-in-comedy-tour/51201ANJTLKTPNSNHSSNGJHMCPQDDDKRV/#event-51201anjtlktpnsnhssngjhmcpqdddkrv\",\n    \"name\": \"Snowed In Comedy Tour\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snowed-in-comedy-tour/51201ANJTLKTPNSNHSSNGJHMCPQDDDKRV/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Regular $63.75 | Senior $52.25 || The Snowed In Comedy Tour is back with a brand new show! Now celebrating its 18th year, what began as a wild idea in the middle of a Canadian winter has snowballed into a national phenomenon and Canada's biggest comedy tour. This year's powerhouse lineup features Dan Quinn, Just for Laughs competition winner and tour founder; Paul Myrehaug, winner of the $25,000 Great Canadian Laugh Off; Pete Zedlacher, SiriusXM Top Comic winner and 6-time Canadian Comedy Award nominee; and Erica Sigurdson, one of CBC's The Debaters most popular performers with more than 80 appearances. Four international comedians. One stage. Eighteen years of laughs. Critics call it “Better than the Just for Laughs Tour” and “A Flurry of Laughs You Can't Miss.”\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/78e6dbf3-3f60-4545-87d5-13c6e935082c.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-04-08T19:30:00-03:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=51201ANJTLKTPNSNHSSNGJHMCPQDDDKRV\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-04-08T19:30:00-03:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Snowed In Comedy Tour\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
