    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A Seating $55.75 || B Seating $45.75 || C Seating $45.75 || Fresh off a packed 2026 run, comedic married duo Darcy and Jer are extending their hit “Average at Best” tour into 2027 - because apparently none of us have learned our lesson. Join Darcy and Jer for a night of hilarious stand up comedy from their neurodiverse marriage, adventures in middle age, family chaos, and the general indignities of trying to keep a relationship alive while spending this much time together. Relatable, ridiculous and occasionally raunchy, Darcy and Jer are bringing “Average at Best” to even more cities in 2027. More dates. More cities. Same marriage. Same disappointments. Somehow, even more material. Come see the internet’s favourite couple live in 2027. The show starts whenever they find parking."
      }
    ],
