        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Tue May 11, 2027 • 8:00pm\n\n  \n          Comedy\n    \n          Stand Up\n      \n\n  Event length: 120 minutes\n\n      Admission $55.75 | Admission $45.75\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Darcy & Jer: Average At Best Tour\n        \n                  \n            A Seating $55.75 || B Seating $45.75 || C Seating $45.75 ||\nFresh off a packed 2026 run, comedic married duo Darcy and Jer are extending their hit “Average\nat Best” tour into 2027 - because apparently none of us have learned our lesson.\nJoin Darcy and Jer for a night of hilarious stand up comedy from their neurodiverse marriage,\nadventures in middle age, family chaos, and the general indignities of trying to keep a relationship\nalive while spending this much time together. Relatable, ridiculous and occasionally raunchy,\nDarcy and Jer are bringing “Average at Best” to even more cities in 2027.\nMore dates. More cities. Same marriage. Same disappointments. Somehow, even more material.\nCome see the internet’s favourite couple live in 2027. The show starts whenever they find parking.\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Comedy      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Stand Up      \n    \n          \n        Event Length: 120 minutes\n      \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/darcy-jer-average-at-best-tour/50001ALBDLSVMDTDTMKNPPLMDQMDRBTLK/#event-50001albdlsvmdtdtmknpplmdqmdrbtlk\",\n    \"name\": \"Darcy & Jer: Average At Best Tour\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/darcy-jer-average-at-best-tour/50001ALBDLSVMDTDTMKNPPLMDQMDRBTLK/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"A Seating $55.75 || B Seating $45.75 || C Seating $45.75 || Fresh off a packed 2026 run, comedic married duo Darcy and Jer are extending their hit “Average at Best” tour into 2027 - because apparently none of us have learned our lesson. Join Darcy and Jer for a night of hilarious stand up comedy from their neurodiverse marriage, adventures in middle age, family chaos, and the general indignities of trying to keep a relationship alive while spending this much time together. Relatable, ridiculous and occasionally raunchy, Darcy and Jer are bringing “Average at Best” to even more cities in 2027. More dates. More cities. Same marriage. Same disappointments. Somehow, even more material. Come see the internet’s favourite couple live in 2027. The show starts whenever they find parking.\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/f1602ff5-cfae-463e-810c-cc0b4a96b7cb.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-05-11T20:00:00-03:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=50001ALBDLSVMDTDTMKNPPLMDQMDRBTLK\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-05-11T20:00:00-03:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Darcy & Jer: Average At Best Tour\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
