      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Wed Jun 2, 2027 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Classical / Orchestra\n      \n\n\n      Adult $49.00 | Student $20.00 | Arts Workers/Indigenous Community $25.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  SNB: Of Words & Images\n        \n                  \n            Call Box Office for Subscription |\nRegular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245\nAccredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125\nStudent: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100 \nYouth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission\nA season closer of radiant colour, weaving Shakespearean magic, heavenly lyricism,\nand Mussorgsky’s evocative Pictures at an Exhibition.\nPour clore la saison en couleurs, un programme où s’entrelacent la magie\nshakespearienne, un lyrisme céleste et les évocateurs Tableaux d’une exposition de\nMoussorgski.\nConductor: Mélanie Léonard\nGuest artist: Camryn Dewar, soprano\nProgram\nF Mendelssohn: Overture \"A Midsummer Nights Dream\" Op. 21 (1826)\nI Cusson: Le Récital des anges\nM Mussorgsky: Pictures at an Exhibition (1874)\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Classical / Orchestra      \n    \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snb-of-words-images/48201AHQBKMVGJSTQGDDLBHBMNSLMGSVN/#event-48201ahqbkmvgjstqgddlbhbmnslmgsvn\",\n    \"name\": \"SNB: Of Words & Images\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snb-of-words-images/48201AHQBKMVGJSTQGDDLBHBMNSLMGSVN/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Call Box Office for Subscription | Regular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245 Accredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125 Student: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100  Youth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission A season closer of radiant colour, weaving Shakespearean magic, heavenly lyricism, and Mussorgsky’s evocative Pictures at an Exhibition. Pour clore la saison en couleurs, un programme où s’entrelacent la magie shakespearienne, un lyrisme céleste et les évocateurs Tableaux d’une exposition de Moussorgski. Conductor: Mélanie Léonard Guest artist: Camryn Dewar, soprano Program F Mendelssohn: Overture \\\"A Midsummer Nights Dream\\\" Op. 21 (1826) I Cusson: Le Récital des anges M Mussorgsky: Pictures at an Exhibition (1874)\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/12b40d2b-0239-4062-aa32-5308e9c4f690.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-06-02T19:30:00-03:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=48201AHQBKMVGJSTQGDDLBHBMNSLMGSVN\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-06-02T19:30:00-03:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"SNB: Of Words & Images\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t"
